# Threads share memory only on a page isolated from other origins; see docs/design/web-build.md.
# A file keeps its name between builds, so every one is revalidated; the service worker is
# what serves them fast and offline.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/*.wasm
  Content-Type: application/wasm

/*.webmanifest
  Content-Type: application/manifest+json
